{"4162610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Lighthouse", "steam_appid": 4162610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Made for you, developed for everyone</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/b2255567393e0bab3ecb0aec66b9aa02.avif?t=1784737494\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras_big/b2255567393e0bab3ecb0aec66b9aa02.webp?t=1784737494 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why should every studio rebuild the same rocks, trees, and barrels from scratch? We share the assets we make, and the know-how behind them, so that other developers get to spend their time on what actually matters: their games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's what a copy of Project Lighthouse actually buys: more free assets, for everyone, forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ten years, Poly Haven has freely given away the kind of 3D assets other companies sell. You've almost certainly already played something built with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created alongside our community, over 100 assets from Project Lighthouse are already available to download and use by anyone, free and CC0, with more on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next indie game you love might have a little Static Rock in it.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Static Rock lighthouse goes dark and contact with its “keepers” is lost, you’re sent to restore its functionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the simple repair job quickly spirals out of control, leaving you trapped in an experiment gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the truth unfolds, you’ll find that the lighthouse hides more than its beam reveals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/94ae8ff74e0e237766c60c3ffa1c59a4.avif?t=1784737494\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras_big/94ae8ff74e0e237766c60c3ffa1c59a4.webp?t=1784737494 width=1560 height=173 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/2752dbd220be038b4bdce644e39ed3e2.poster.avif?t=1784737494\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/2752dbd220be038b4bdce644e39ed3e2.webm?t=1784737494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/2752dbd220be038b4bdce644e39ed3e2.mp4?t=1784737494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dynamics of an evolving technology as you manipulate your surroundings to solve spatial puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/690b1ed4dc93be3c5af270a4c9674553.avif?t=1784737494\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras_big/690b1ed4dc93be3c5af270a4c9674553.webp?t=1784737494 width=1560 height=173 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/c5d013826550c538cea19e5ffc692417.poster.avif?t=1784737494\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/c5d013826550c538cea19e5ffc692417.webm?t=1784737494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/c5d013826550c538cea19e5ffc692417.mp4?t=1784737494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse crumbling military ruins, explore labyrinths of secret labs, and ascend the iconic lighthouse as you progress through an atmospheric island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/b121cc1b3e27cdf2c8c5df5804cafb90.avif?t=1784737494\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras_big/b121cc1b3e27cdf2c8c5df5804cafb90.webp?t=1784737494 width=1560 height=173 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/ef4042047d85ba65d60b8480a15c3d00.poster.avif?t=1784737494\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/ef4042047d85ba65d60b8480a15c3d00.webm?t=1784737494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/ef4042047d85ba65d60b8480a15c3d00.mp4?t=1784737494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island inhabitants have disappeared. The secrets they held still remain. Delve into the lingering mystery behind a teleportation experiment as you find a way to leave the island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/1e1a0a5cbbe97965612d246cfa0617d8.avif?t=1784737494\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras_big/1e1a0a5cbbe97965612d246cfa0617d8.avif?t=1784737494 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the game or for the free assets it funds, that <strong>wishlist </strong>button at the top of the page is the most helpful click you've got. It helps Steam decide which games deserve attention. We'll email you on launch day &lt;3</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Static Rock lighthouse goes dark and contact with its “keepers” is lost, you’re sent to restore its functionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the simple repair job quickly spirals out of control, leaving you trapped in an experiment gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the truth unfolds, you’ll find that the lighthouse hides more than its beam reveals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/94ae8ff74e0e237766c60c3ffa1c59a4.avif?t=1784737494\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras_big/94ae8ff74e0e237766c60c3ffa1c59a4.webp?t=1784737494 width=1560 height=173 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/2752dbd220be038b4bdce644e39ed3e2.poster.avif?t=1784737494\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/2752dbd220be038b4bdce644e39ed3e2.webm?t=1784737494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162610/extras/2752dbd220be038b4bdce644e39ed3e2.mp4?t=1784737494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dynamics of an evolving technology as you manipulate your surroundings to solve spatial puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.a